// scaffold standard library — public entry point.
//
// A project template opts into the schema with a single `import
// <scaffold.wcl>` line at the top. This file pulls in the prelude, which
// in turn imports every part of the library. The parts are embedded in
// the `wcl` binary and resolved through a registry (see
// `crates/wcl/src/scaffold/stdlib.rs`); the angle-bracket path is
// importer-relative within the `<wcl-system>` namespace, so `import
// <scaffold/prelude.wcl>` here resolves to that key.

namespace scaffold

import <scaffold/prelude.wcl>
